<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct heavy oil output down 15.10 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct heavy oil output down 15.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's heavy oil output totalled 18.0694 million tonnes from January to October, down by 15.10 percent compared with the same period last year, the Statistical Bureau said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Heavy oil production in October alone was 1.6961 million tonnes, the bureau said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
